* news_process — Table A8: 固定效应饱和阶梯 + 离群稳健估计量
*                           (FE Saturation Ladder + Outlier-Robust Estimators)
*
* Bundle A (bank_fintech_tone P1 稳健性缺口补全; 全 $0, 列均在盘/golden-safe, 纯 Stata):
*   Panel A — 替代固定效应饱和阶梯 (FE-SAT, 5 列):
*     M0 银行 + 年 (bank_id + year, = 主表 11_table2 基线 TWFE)
*     M1 + 省份×年 (i.bank_province#i.year, 吸收地方时变冲击: 区域监管/经济周期)
*     M2 + 银行类型×年 (i.bank_type#i.year, 吸收国有/股份/城商等所有制时变政策)
*     M3 + 区域×年 (i.bank_zone#i.year, 吸收沿海/内陆等地带时变冲击)
*     M4 + 银行特定线性趋势 (c.year#i.bank_id, 吸收银行各自的平滑时间路径)
*   Panel B — 离群稳健估计量 (ROBUST-EST, 3 列对照):
*     OLS (reghdfe 基线, 主表口径) vs 中位数回归 qreg(.5) vs
*       Huber+Tukey biweight IRLS 有界影响 M-估计 rreg (非 Yohai 1987 MM-估计)
*
* 为什么 (大白话):
*   A 这一组回答审稿人对双向固定效应 (TWFE) 设计的标准追问 "你的系数是不是被某种
*     没控住的、随时间变动的地区/所有制/地带差异带出来的?" —— 逐级把更细的"组×年"
*     固定效应塞进去, 若主系数还稳, 说明结论对未观测时变异质性是饱和稳健的。
*   B 这一组回答 "结果是不是被个别离群的银行-年数据点带出来的?" —— 缩尾 (winsor)
*     是改数据的值, 而中位数回归/稳健回归是换估计量 (对离群点降权), 两者互补。
*
* 文献锚点 (DOI 已核验):
*   Gormley, T. A., & Matsa, D. A. (2014). Common Errors: How to (and Not to)
*     Control for Unobserved Heterogeneity. Review of Financial Studies, 27(2),
*     617-661. https://doi.org/10.1093/rfs/hht047        [Panel A 固定效应饱和]
*   Leone, A. J., Minutti-Meza, M., & Wasley, C. E. (2019). Influential
*     Observations and Inference in Accounting Research. The Accounting Review,
*     94(6), 337-364. https://doi.org/10.2308/accr-52396  [Panel B 离群稳健估计]
*   Koenker, R., & Bassett, G. (1978). Regression Quantiles. Econometrica,
*     46(1), 33-50. https://doi.org/10.2307/1913643        [qreg 分位回归]
*
* T=2 退化守卫: 当前试跑盘 years={2017,2018} (~174 行, T=2)。c.year#i.bank_id 银行
*   线性趋势在 T=2 下与 bank+year FE 完全共线 → reghdfe 自动吸收/或回归退化, 用
*   capture + N/df 守卫优雅跳过 (production T=19 才有功效)。qreg/rreg 在小样本仅近似
*   FE (i.year, T 充足时加 i.bank_type 哑变量), 同样 capture 守卫。
*
* ⚠ 披露 (FUNDINGCOST-NOT-WINSORIZED): 本表载入 _prepared_panel ("同口径缩尾面板"),
*   但该口径的 winsor 清单 (root 01_data_prep) 只缩尾在盘的情感/控制变量。本表 Panel B
*   的 DV (llm_vote_tone) 已在缩尾清单内; 而本论文族 (含 33_tableA9) 用作财务 outcome
*   的 funding_cost 不在 01_data_prep winsor 清单 → 财务面板接入后, funding_cost 仍是
*   "未缩尾"状态 (本表不改 01_data_prep)。Panel B 的离群稳健估计 (qreg/rreg) 正好
*   补位: 不依赖缩尾即可对离群点降权。
*
* Main spec: sent={{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}} (locus={{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}} subst={{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}})

version 19

* fix(omni-g-templates-14): 每表开头 eststo clear 隔离估计命名空间 (master 共享 session)。
eststo clear

* 载入与主表同口径的缩尾面板 (_prepared_panel; 缺失回退未缩尾 full.dta)
capture confirm file "data/processed/_prepared_panel.dta"
if !_rc {
    use "data/processed/_prepared_panel.dta", clear
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ _prepared_panel.dta 不存在 (应先跑 01_data_prep); 回退未缩尾 full.dta"
    use "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_full.dta", clear
}

capture confirm variable bank_id
if _rc {
    encode target_bank, gen(bank_id)
}
xtset bank_id year
capture do "data/processed/46_panel_yearly_labels.do"

local DV     llm_vote_tone_{{MAIN_SENT_TRACK}}
local EXPL   digital_frontier
local LOCUS  tech_frac_{{MAIN_LOCUS_TRACK}}
local SUBST  symb_frac_{{MAIN_SUBST_TRACK}}

* DV / EXPL 存在性守卫 (缺则整表无意义, 优雅退出)
capture confirm variable `DV' `EXPL'
if _rc {
    display as error "  ⚠️ DV (`DV') 或 EXPL (`EXPL') 不在面板, Table A8 整表跳过 (degrade)"
    exit 0
}

* LOCUS/SUBST ctx 控制守卫 (full 轨展开成幻影列 tech_frac_lf/symb_frac_sf 时缺失)。
capture confirm variable `LOCUS' `SUBST'
if _rc {
    display "  ⚠️ LOCUS/SUBST 列缺 (`LOCUS' / `SUBST'): 回归 degrade 为不含 LOCUS/SUBST"
    local LOCUS
    local SUBST
}

* 字符型分组列编码为数值 (reghdfe 的 i.var#i.year 交互需数值因子; bank_province/
* bank_type/bank_zone 在盘均为 string)。capture confirm 守卫缺列。
capture confirm variable bank_province
if !_rc {
    capture confirm variable _prov_id
    if _rc encode bank_province, gen(_prov_id)
}
capture confirm variable bank_type
if !_rc {
    capture confirm variable _type_id
    if _rc encode bank_type, gen(_type_id)
}
capture confirm variable bank_zone
if !_rc {
    capture confirm variable _zone_id
    if _rc encode bank_zone, gen(_zone_id)
}

* ==========================================================================
* Panel A — 固定效应饱和阶梯 (FE-SAT)
* ==========================================================================
* 逐级把更细的 group×year 固定效应吸收进去, 看主系数 β(digital_frontier) 稳不稳。
eststo clear
local fecols ""
local felabs ""

* M0 基线: bank + year (= 主表 11_table2 双向固定效应)
capture eststo FE0: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
if !_rc {
    local fecols "`fecols' FE0"
    local felabs `"`felabs' "Bank+Year""'
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel A M0 基线回归失败, 跳过"
}

* M1 + 省份×年
capture confirm variable _prov_id
if !_rc {
    capture eststo FE1: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year i.year#i._prov_id) vce(cluster bank_id)
    if !_rc {
        local fecols "`fecols' FE1"
        local felabs `"`felabs' "+Prov×Yr""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel A M1 (+省份×年) 回归失败/退化, 跳过 (T=2 试跑盘可能共线)"
    }
}

* M2 + 银行类型×年
capture confirm variable _type_id
if !_rc {
    capture eststo FE2: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year i.year#i._type_id) vce(cluster bank_id)
    if !_rc {
        local fecols "`fecols' FE2"
        local felabs `"`felabs' "+Type×Yr""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel A M2 (+类型×年) 回归失败/退化, 跳过"
    }
}

* M3 + 区域×年
capture confirm variable _zone_id
if !_rc {
    capture eststo FE3: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year i.year#i._zone_id) vce(cluster bank_id)
    if !_rc {
        local fecols "`fecols' FE3"
        local felabs `"`felabs' "+Zone×Yr""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel A M3 (+区域×年) 回归失败/退化, 跳过"
    }
}

* M4 + 银行特定线性趋势 (c.year#i.bank_id) — 需 T≥3 才可识别 (T=2 与 bank+year FE 共线)
quietly levelsof year, local(_yrs)
local _T : word count `_yrs'
if `_T' >= 3 {
    capture eststo FE4: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
        absorb(bank_id year c.year#i.bank_id) vce(cluster bank_id)
    if !_rc {
        local fecols "`fecols' FE4"
        local felabs `"`felabs' "+Bank trend""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel A M4 (+银行线性趋势) 回归失败, 跳过"
    }
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel A M4 跳过: 银行特定线性趋势需 T>=3 (当前 T=`_T'); 全量 T=19 下有功效"
}

* ── FE-ROBUST IDENTIFICATION (D1-digital_frontier fix 2026-06-16) ──
* ⚠ digital_frontier 是【基年、银行内时间不变】的 0/1 银行分类, 在上面所有
* absorb(bank_id ...) 的 FE-饱和列 (M0-M4) 里都与银行固定效应【完全共线】→ reghdfe
* 静默 drop, β(digital_frontier) 主效应在这些列【根本无法识别】(那一行其实是空的);
* 它仅在【无吸收】回归 (主表 11_table2 的 M1, noabsorb) 里可识别。这正是本表 FE 饱和
* 阶梯的盲点: 加再多 group×year FE 也救不回一个被 bank FE 吃光的时间不变变量。
* 为在 bank-FE 设定下恢复"数字化前沿"的可识别信号, 补一列银行内随时间变动形式
* c.digital_frontier##i.year (交乘项【不会】被 bank FE 吸收, 基年自动省略), 镜像
* 34_tableA11 Panel B 的 c.`EXPL'##i.era ... absorb(bank_id year) 工作模式 (按年 i.year
* 而非按时代 i.era)。守卫: year 须 ≥2 取值; 缺/单年/退化时 capture noisily 优雅跳过。
* 因交乘项系数名 (`年'.year#c.digital_frontier) 不是裸 `EXPL', 该列入表时 keep() 须
* 放开 (见下方 `keepopt' 动态构造), 否则 keep(digital_frontier) 会把交乘项全过滤掉。
capture confirm variable year
if !_rc {
    quietly levelsof year, local(_yrs_fr)
    local _ny_fr : word count `_yrs_fr'
    if `_ny_fr' >= 2 {
        capture noisily eststo FE_ROB: reghdfe `DV' c.`EXPL'##i.year `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
            absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
        if !_rc {
            local fecols "`fecols' FE_ROB"
            local felabs `"`felabs' "FE-robust x year""'
        }
        else {
            display "  ⚠️ Panel A FE-robust (c.`EXPL'##i.year) 回归退化 (rc=`=_rc'), 跳过 — 不影响 M0-M4"
        }
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel A FE-robust 跳过: year 仅 `_ny_fr' 个取值 (需 ≥2 才有交乘变异); 全量 T=19 有功效"
    }
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel A FE-robust 跳过: year 不在面板, 无法构造 c.`EXPL'##i.year"
}

* 输出 Panel A (动态名单, 缺列不点名)
* keep 动态化: 仅 FE-饱和列 (M0-M4) 时 keep(`EXPL') 只显主系数; 一旦含 FE_ROB
* (c.`EXPL'##i.year 交乘列), keep() 放开为全系数, 否则交乘项被 keep(digital_frontier)
* 过滤掉、FE_ROB 那列变空。
if "`fecols'" != "" {
    local keepopt keep(`EXPL')
    if `: list FE_ROB in fecols' {
        local keepopt ""
    }
    esttab `fecols' using "output/tables/tableA8a_fe_saturation.tex", ///
        `keepopt' se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) booktabs replace fragment ///
        title("Table A8-A: Fixed-Effects Saturation Ladder (Gormley & Matsa 2014 RFS)") ///
        mtitles(`felabs') ///
        note("DV = bank-year tone (`DV'). Each column adds a finer group-by-year FE set: " ///
             "province×year, bank-type×year, zone×year, and bank-specific linear trend. " ///
             "SE clustered at bank. Stability of beta(digital_frontier) across the ladder " ///
             "addresses unobserved time-varying heterogeneity (Gormley & Matsa 2014 RFS, 10.1093/rfs/hht047). " ///
             "IDENTIFICATION NOTE: digital_frontier is a base-year within-bank time-invariant 0/1 classifier; " ///
             "in EVERY absorb(bank_id ...) column here (M0-M4) it is collinear with the bank FE and silently " ///
             "dropped, so beta(digital_frontier) is NOT identified in the FE columns — it is identified only in " ///
             "the no-absorb column M1 of the main table (11_table2). The final FE-robust column recovers an " ///
             "identified signal via c.digital_frontier##i.year (interaction terms are NOT absorbed; base year omitted). " ///
             "Note: this is an OLS descriptive equation (tone ~ digital_frontier); the M2 bank-type×year " ///
             "FE here is NOT imposed on the Table A6 2SLS, whose Bartik bank-type instrument requires " ///
             "type×year variation to remain excluded. The two are complementary, not in conflict: A8-A " ///
             "saturates type×year as a descriptive robustness check; A6 leaves it out for IV identification.")
    estout `fecols' using "output/tables/tableA8a_fe_saturation.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
        cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
        starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) `keepopt'
    display "✅ Table A8-A (FE saturation ladder) written"
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel A 无任何可用列, 跳过整张 A8-A"
}

* ==========================================================================
* Panel B — 离群稳健估计量 (ROBUST-EST: OLS vs qreg vs rreg)
* ==========================================================================
* OLS 主表口径 vs 中位数回归 qreg(.5) vs Huber+Tukey biweight IRLS 有界影响 M-估计 rreg。
* (rreg = Huber + Tukey biweight 迭代加权 M-估计, 非 Yohai 1987 MM-估计。)
* qreg/rreg 不能吸收高维 FE → 用 i.year (T 充足时加 i.bank_type 哑变量) 近似。
eststo clear
local rcols ""
local rlabs ""

* B1: OLS 对照 (reghdfe 基线, bank+year FE)
capture eststo RB_ols: reghdfe `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST', ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster bank_id)
if !_rc {
    local rcols "`rcols' RB_ols"
    local rlabs `"`rlabs' "OLS (FE)""'
}

* 近似 FE 列表 (i.year 总是; bank_type 多类别哑变量, T 足够大才不过参数化)
local approx_fe i.year
capture confirm variable _type_id
if !_rc {
    quietly levelsof _type_id, local(_types)
    local _ntype : word count `_types'
    quietly count
    * 仅当样本数足够支撑类型哑变量时加入 (粗略: N > 5×类别数)
    if r(N) > 5 * `_ntype' {
        local approx_fe i.year i.bank_type
    }
}

* B2: 中位数回归 qreg(.5) (Koenker & Bassett 1978 ECMA)
* 先试富 FE (`approx_fe' = i.year [+ i.bank_type]); 若小样本下因哑变量过参数化失败,
* 退回仅 i.year 重试 (T=2 试跑盘加 i.bank_type 可能共线 → 回退仍可产出主系数)。
capture which qreg
if !_rc {
    capture eststo RB_qreg: qreg `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST' `approx_fe', quantile(0.5)
    if _rc {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel B: qreg(.5) 富 FE 失败 (rc=`=_rc'), 退回仅 i.year 重试"
        capture eststo RB_qreg: qreg `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST' i.year, quantile(0.5)
    }
    if !_rc {
        local rcols "`rcols' RB_qreg"
        local rlabs `"`rlabs' "Median (qreg .5)""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel B: qreg(.5) 仍失败 (样本/退化?), 跳过中位数回归"
    }
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel B: qreg 未找到 (Stata 自带, 异常); 跳过中位数回归"
}

* B3: Huber+Tukey biweight IRLS 有界影响 M-估计 rreg (对离群点迭代降权; 非 MM-估计)
* 同 qreg: 富 FE 失败则退回 i.year 重试。rreg 先按 Cook's D 剔除强影响点再迭代,
* T=2 + 缺值模式下可能把全部观测剔光 (rc=2000 "no observations") → 优雅跳过,
* 全量 T=19 下有功效。
capture which rreg
if !_rc {
    capture eststo RB_rreg: rreg `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST' `approx_fe'
    if _rc {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel B: rreg 富 FE 失败 (rc=`=_rc'), 退回仅 i.year 重试"
        capture eststo RB_rreg: rreg `DV' `EXPL' `LOCUS' `SUBST' i.year
    }
    if !_rc {
        local rcols "`rcols' RB_rreg"
        local rlabs `"`rlabs' "Robust (rreg)""'
    }
    else {
        display "  ⚠️ Panel B: rreg 仍失败 (T=2 强影响点剔除致无观测?), 跳过稳健回归 (全量 T=19 有功效)"
    }
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel B: rreg 未找到 (Stata 自带, 异常); 跳过稳健回归"
}

* 输出 Panel B (动态名单)
if "`rcols'" != "" {
    esttab `rcols' using "output/tables/tableA8b_robust_estimators.tex", ///
        keep(`EXPL') se star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) booktabs replace fragment ///
        title("Table A8-B: Outlier-Robust Estimators (Leone et al. 2019 TAR)") ///
        mtitles(`rlabs') ///
        note("DV = `DV'. OLS = reghdfe with bank+year FE (main spec). Median = qreg(.5); " ///
             "Robust = rreg (Huber + Tukey biweight IRLS, bounded-influence M-estimator; NOT a " ///
             "Yohai 1987 MM-estimator). qreg/rreg approximate FE with year (and bank-type when " ///
             "sample permits) dummies. Beyond winsorizing (which alters values), these change the " ///
             "estimator to downweight influential observations " ///
             "(Leone et al. 2019 TAR, 10.2308/accr-52396; Koenker & Bassett 1978 ECMA, 10.2307/1913643). " ///
             "SE bases are NOT comparable across columns: OLS uses bank-clustered SE, qreg uses iid " ///
             "sparsity-based SE, rreg uses IRLS SE; read significance within-column, not across.")
    estout `rcols' using "output/tables/tableA8b_robust_estimators.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
        cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N, fmt(0)) ///
        starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) keep(`EXPL')
    display "✅ Table A8-B (outlier-robust estimators) written"
}
else {
    display "  ⚠️ Panel B 无任何可用列, 跳过整张 A8-B"
}

display "✅ Table A8 (FE 饱和阶梯 + 离群稳健估计量) 完成 — A 固定效应饱和 / B 离群稳健估计"
